OL,3,GNEWSASix arrested over separate
OL,4,Aassaults on police officers in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have been arrested and
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with separate
OL,8,Fincidents of alleged assaults on police
OL,9,Fofficers in Glasgow city centre over
OL,10,Fthe weekend.
OL,12,FPolice Scotland said three of the men,
OL,13,Faged 34, 35 and 40, were due to have
OL,14,Fappeared at Glasgow Sheriff Court on
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,17,FTwo men aged, 38 and 43, were reported
OL,18,Fto the procurator fiscal.
OL,20,FA teenage girl was also issued with a
OL,21,Frecorded police warning.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
